ADMIN & SECURITY: Include an admin dashboard for managing users, posts, videos, reports, and announcements. Add secure authentication, permissions, content moderation, privacy protection, and database integration.
TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS: Make the app responsive, fast, easy to use, and suitable for Android phones. Connect real backend services and APIs where required. Do not use fake buttons, hardcoded live scores, or pretend functionality. If a service requires an API key, account, payment, or permission, clearly explain what is needed.
